~ convo_3
Winston: Hey, pint-size, you seem close with Az
Fenn: Oh yeah! She's great
Winston: D-Does she, like... I dunno... 
Fenn: What?	Winston: Wh-what does she, like, th-think about me? Does she think I'm cool?
Fenn: Yeah of course! Everyone thinks you're cool!
Winston: Really?!
Az: NO! Fenn, stop making stuff up.
Fenn: But I wasn't...
Winston whispering: I forgot she was there...
=> END

